--- an OID the server does not know is rendered as text
text	text	text
--- the modifier carries the timestamp precision and the numeric precision and scale
timestamp(3) without time zone	timestamp(6) with time zone	timestamp(0) without time zone[]
numeric(20,2)	numeric(20,0)[]	numeric
